  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial release:\n- Result pattern for type-safe error handling\n- Domain entity base classes with domain events, audit fields, and soft delete\n- Permission-based authorization system\n- API versioning support\n- Swagger/OpenAPI configuration with JWT authentication\n- Endpoint mapping with convention-based discovery\n- HttpClient token forwarding\n- Result error translation to Problem Details (RFC 7807)\n- Pagination support\n- AES encryption helpers\n- JSON converters and serialization utilities",
